; STYLE table read into the model and rewritten from it ([0.8-RT11], work #683).
; stili.dxf is handwritten (R2018, LF): $TEXTSTYLE = Larghezza08 and the STYLE records
; in this order: Standard (font arial.ttf, 40=0, 41=1, 50=0, 71=0: the Standard of a new
; session, sheet PT11 point 2, so not listed in "text styles:"); Altezza5 (40=5, XDATA ACAD
; kept in extras); a shape file record (70 bit 1, empty name, ltypeshp.shx) that stays raw
; and is not a text style; Larghezza08 (romans.shx, bigfont gbcbig.shx, 41=0.8, 50=15
; degrees); Capovolto (71=6: bit 2 backwards, bit 4 upside down; DXF reference, STYLE).
; Expected fields from docs/verifica/rapporto.md, "Stili e blocchi": table order, oblique in
; degrees, current style because it is not Standard. Saving and reopening gives the same.
; cambia con #683
OPEN
stili.dxf
!report
SAVE
stili-riscritto.dxf
OPEN
stili-riscritto.dxf
